<section id="A1" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix A </span>Appendix: Finite-Time Analysis of NSF1 and GSF1</h2>

<section id="A1.SSx1" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection">A.1 Assumptions Used in the Analysis</h3>

<div id="A1.SSx1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SSx1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We recall the assumptions used throughout the proof:</p>
</div>
<div id="A1.SSx1.p2" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<ul id="A1.I1" class="ltx_itemize">
<li id="A1.I1.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A1.I1.i1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.I1.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.I1.i1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">(A1)</span> For all <math id="A1.I1.i1.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\theta\in\mathcal{C}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>θ</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒞</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\theta\in\mathcal{C}</annotation></semantics></math>, the Markov chain is irreducible and aperiodic, and the fundamental matrix <math id="A1.I1.i1.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="Z_{\theta}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>Z</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">Z_{\theta}</annotation></semantics></math> is uniformly bounded.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A1.I1.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A1.I1.i2.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.I1.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.I1.i2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">(A2)</span> The mappings <math id="A1.I1.i2.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\theta\mapsto P_{\theta}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>θ</mi><mo stretchy="false">↦</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\theta\mapsto P_{\theta}</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="A1.I1.i2.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\theta\mapsto h_{\theta}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>θ</mi><mo stretchy="false">↦</mo><msub><mi>h</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\theta\mapsto h_{\theta}</annotation></semantics></math> are <math id="A1.I1.i2.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="C^{3}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msup><mi>C</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">C^{3}</annotation></semantics></math>, implying boundedness of derivatives up to order 3.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A1.I1.i3" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A1.I1.i3.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.I1.i3.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.I1.i3.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">(Lemma 1)</span> <math id="A1.I1.i3.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\nabla J(\theta)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><mi>J</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\nabla J(\theta)</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="A1.I1.i3.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\nabla^{2}J(\theta)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msup><mo>∇</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>J</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\nabla^{2}J(\theta)</annotation></semantics></math> are Lipschitz continuous on <math id="A1.I1.i3.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{C}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒞</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{C}</annotation></semantics></math>.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A1.I1.i4" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A1.I1.i4.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.I1.i4.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.I1.i4.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">(Lemma 2)</span> <math id="A1.I1.i4.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\sup_{\theta\in\mathcal{C}}\mathbb{E}[h(\theta,X)^{4}]&lt;\infty" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mo>sup</mo><mrow><mi>θ</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒞</mi></mrow></msub><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>X</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>4</mn></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>&lt;</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">∞</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\sup_{\theta\in\mathcal{C}}\mathbb{E}[h(\theta,X)^{4}]&lt;\infty</annotation></semantics></math>.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A1.I1.i5" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A1.I1.i5.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.I1.i5.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.I1.i5.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">(A3)</span> Step-sizes: <math id="A1.I1.i5.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="a(m)=(1+m)^{-\sigma}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>σ</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">a(m)=(1+m)^{-\sigma}</annotation></semantics></math>, <math id="A1.I1.i5.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="c(m)=(1+m)^{-\alpha}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>α</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">c(m)=(1+m)^{-\alpha}</annotation></semantics></math>, <math id="A1.I1.i5.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="b(m)=(1+m)^{-\nu}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>ν</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">b(m)=(1+m)^{-\nu}</annotation></semantics></math> with <math id="A1.I1.i5.p1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="0&lt;\nu&lt;\alpha&lt;\sigma&lt;1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>ν</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>α</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>σ</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">0&lt;\nu&lt;\alpha&lt;\sigma&lt;1</annotation></semantics></math>.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A1.I1.i6" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A1.I1.i6.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.I1.i6.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.I1.i6.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">(A4)</span> <math id="A1.I1.i6.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="M(m)=(H(m)+\lambda I)^{-1}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>M</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>H</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>λ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>I</mi></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">M(m)=(H(m)+\lambda I)^{-1}</annotation></semantics></math> is uniformly bounded and positive definite.</p>
</div></li>
</ul>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A1.SSx2" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection">A.2 Mean-Squared Error Decomposition</h3>

<div id="A1.SSx2.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SSx2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Define</p>
<table id="A1.Ex62" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.Ex62.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\epsilon_{i,j}(m)=H_{i,j}(m)-H^{*}_{i,j}(m)," display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>ϵ</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>H</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>H</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow><mo>∗</mo></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\epsilon_{i,j}(m)=H_{i,j}(m)-H^{*}_{i,j}(m),</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SSx2.p1.2" class="ltx_p">where <math id="A1.SSx2.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="H^{*}(m)=\nabla^{2}J(\theta(m))" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msup><mi>H</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><msup><mo rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>J</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>θ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">H^{*}(m)=\nabla^{2}J(\theta(m))</annotation></semantics></math>.</p>
</div>
<div id="A1.SSx2.p2" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SSx2.p2.1" class="ltx_p">Then,</p>
<table id="A1.Ex63" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.Ex63.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\|H(m)-H^{*}(m)\|_{F}^{2}=\sum_{i=1}^{d}\epsilon_{i,i}(m)^{2}+\sum_{i\neq j}\epsilon_{i,j}(m)^{2}." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>H</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><msup><mi>H</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mi>F</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo rspace="0.111em">=</mo><mrow><mrow><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>d</mi></munderover><mrow><msub><mi>ϵ</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="0.055em">+</mo><mrow><munder><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>≠</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow></munder><mrow><msub><mi>ϵ</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\|H(m)-H^{*}(m)\|_{F}^{2}=\sum_{i=1}^{d}\epsilon_{i,i}(m)^{2}+\sum_{i\neq j}\epsilon_{i,j}(m)^{2}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div id="A1.SSx2.p3" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SSx2.p3.1" class="ltx_p">We analyze diagonal terms; off-diagonal terms follow similarly.</p>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A1.SSx3" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection">A.3 Recursion for Diagonal Error</h3>

<div id="A1.SSx3.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SSx3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">From the update,</p>
<table id="A1.Ex64" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.Ex64.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="H_{i,i}(m+1)=H_{i,i}(m)+b(m)\left[\frac{\eta_{i}(m)^{2}-1}{\beta^{2}}h(X_{m})-H_{i,i}(m)\right]," display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>H</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>H</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>[</mo><mrow><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>η</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><msup><mi>β</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>h</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>X</mi><mi>m</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><msub><mi>H</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">H_{i,i}(m+1)=H_{i,i}(m)+b(m)\left[\frac{\eta_{i}(m)^{2}-1}{\beta^{2}}h(X_{m})-H_{i,i}(m)\right],</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div id="A1.SSx3.p2" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SSx3.p2.1" class="ltx_p">subtracting <math id="A1.SSx3.p2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="H^{*}_{i,i}(m+1)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>H</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow><mo>∗</mo></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">H^{*}_{i,i}(m+1)</annotation></semantics></math> gives:</p>
<table id="A1.EGx16" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.Ex65"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex65.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\epsilon_{i,i}(m+1)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>ϵ</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\epsilon_{i,i}(m+1)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex65.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\epsilon_{i,i}(m)-b(m)\epsilon_{i,i}(m)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>ϵ</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>ϵ</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\epsilon_{i,i}(m)-b(m)\epsilon_{i,i}(m)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.Ex66"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex66.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\quad+b(m)\left[\frac{\eta_{i}(m)^{2}-1}{\beta^{2}}h(X_{m})-H^{*}_{i,i}(m)\right]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>[</mo><mrow><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>η</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><msup><mi>β</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>h</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>X</mi><mi>m</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>H</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow><mo>∗</mo></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\quad+b(m)\left[\frac{\eta_{i}(m)^{2}-1}{\beta^{2}}h(X_{m})-H^{*}_{i,i}(m)\right]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.Ex67"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex67.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\quad+\left(H^{*}_{i,i}(m)-H^{*}_{i,i}(m+1)\right)." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mi>H</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow><mo>∗</mo></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>H</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow><mo>∗</mo></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\quad+\left(H^{*}_{i,i}(m)-H^{*}_{i,i}(m+1)\right).</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div id="A1.SSx3.p3" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SSx3.p3.1" class="ltx_p">Define</p>
<table id="A1.Ex68" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.Ex68.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\xi_{i}(m):=\frac{\eta_{i}(m)^{2}-1}{\beta^{2}}h(X_{m})-H^{*}_{i,i}(m),\quad\Delta_{i}(m):=H^{*}_{i,i}(m)-H^{*}_{i,i}(m+1)." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>ξ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>:=</mo><mrow><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>η</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><msup><mi>β</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>h</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>X</mi><mi>m</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>H</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow><mo>∗</mo></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="1.167em">,</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>:=</mo><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mi>H</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow><mo>∗</mo></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>H</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow><mo>∗</mo></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\xi_{i}(m):=\frac{\eta_{i}(m)^{2}-1}{\beta^{2}}h(X_{m})-H^{*}_{i,i}(m),\quad\Delta_{i}(m):=H^{*}_{i,i}(m)-H^{*}_{i,i}(m+1).</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div id="A1.SSx3.p4" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SSx3.p4.1" class="ltx_p">Thus,</p>
<table id="A1.Ex69" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.Ex69.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\epsilon_{i,i}(m+1)=(1-b(m))\epsilon_{i,i}(m)+b(m)\xi_{i}(m)+\Delta_{i}(m)." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>ϵ</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>ϵ</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>ξ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\epsilon_{i,i}(m+1)=(1-b(m))\epsilon_{i,i}(m)+b(m)\xi_{i}(m)+\Delta_{i}(m).</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A1.SSx4" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection">A.4 Squaring and Expanding</h3>

<div id="A1.SSx4.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SSx4.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Squaring both sides:</p>
<table id="A1.EGx17" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.Ex70"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex70.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\epsilon_{i,i}(m+1)^{2}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>ϵ</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\epsilon_{i,i}(m+1)^{2}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex70.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=(1-b(m))^{2}\epsilon_{i,i}(m)^{2}+b(m)^{2}\xi_{i}(m)^{2}+\Delta_{i}(m)^{2}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>ϵ</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>ξ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=(1-b(m))^{2}\epsilon_{i,i}(m)^{2}+b(m)^{2}\xi_{i}(m)^{2}+\Delta_{i}(m)^{2}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
